note [Colors and Console Libraries Demonstration in E++ (.enppl)]
add the "Colors" library
add the "Console" library

note [1. Colored Terminal Messages]
say green "✓ Success: Build completed successfully!"
say blue "ℹ Info: Initializing environment modules..."
say yellow "⚠ Warning: High memory usage detected."
say red "✗ Error: Connection timeout on port 8080."
say cyan "✦ Notice: Welcome to E++ 1.3.5!"
say magenta "★ Milestone: All 9 libraries operational."

note [2. Clearing Screen]
say "Terminal colors rendered cleanly."
